  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>BECOME A SOUSS AFFILIATE</b></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); font-family: Bureau-grot, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Born in the UK. Souss has lived to serve the women with style, the women who love to feel confident in what they wear and the women who do things their own way.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); font-family: Bureau-grot, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Expect to find the statement pieces with an affordable price-tag that you won't find anywhere else. We design in-house collections that ultimately embody the classic Souss signature: sexy yet feminine pieces, perfect for the high octane lifestyle.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(74, 74, 74); font-family: Bureau-grot, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Inspired by the muses of our past and present, by all the bad ass women who ever existed, we have cultivated a brand with ever-lasting attitude. Fashion is what matters to us the most and to the women who wear our clothes, for them Souss brings the timeless pieces to treasure and keep.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>WHY JOIN US?</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The Souss program has some pretty amazing perks, to name a few:</span></p><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- Regular affiliate communication updates</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- Opportunities to run exclusive partnerships with Souss</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- A range of fresh and exciting banners, updated regularly</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- Regularly updated feeds with a variety of brand new, on trend products</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 30 day cookies</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- Last-click referral</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- £30 AOV</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- Daily onsite promotions</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- Track your results and optimise your activity to maximise your revenue</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*This is the average cookie period; however, this may vary depending on your website’s functionality.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">THE LEGAL STUFF</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">There are some sites out there that aren’t quite so trustworthy, so we do need to run some checks before you will be approved on the programme. Plus, we'll need you to read and stick to the terms and conditions which you can view on our programme profile pages. Once you have been successfully accepted as a Souss affiliate you can start earning commission straightaway.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">THE TECHY STUFF</span></b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-rendering: auto; text-align: justify;\"></p><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"SuperGroteskOffc, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><b><br></b></font></div><span style=\"color: rgb(74, 74, 74); font-family: Bureau-grot, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px