  "term_and_condition": "<p>Welcome to Souss! Thanks for joining our Affiliate program.</p><p>These following terms and conditions apply to individuals who are accessing or using the Program as an affiliate who refers customers to use product from the merchant.</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Creative</span></p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">Affiliates may not alter the creative or text links provided through the interface without prior approval.</li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">Affiliates are requested not to hard code creative banners so updates are immediate.</li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">Bespoke creative can be provided by our design team at short notice to support you.</li></ul><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Product Feed</span></p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">The Souss product feed is updated regularly&nbsp;and affiliates are required to maintain accurate prices to avoid dissapointment.</li></ul><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Voucher Codes</span></p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">Affiliates may only use voucher codes provided through the interface.</li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">We reserve the right to decline commisions obtained through non-authorised voucher codes.</li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">Voucher codes must be accompanied by their terms and expiry date where appropriate.</li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">Souss voucher codes can only be used on full price Souss tems.</li></ul><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Toolbar Affiliates</span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">Souss will consider working with toolbar publishers who can track performance of the toolbar separately to other activity and allow Souss control of any promotions featured on toolbars</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Branding</span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">When referencing Souss, please ensure that you have a capital M&nbsp;only and no spaces. Please ensure you are also using the most up to date logo which is used on the network profile - if you need different sizes please get in touch.</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Copy</span></p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">Souss requires prior approval of copy that is appearing in online or offline media.&nbsp;</li></ul><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">I-Frames &amp; Masked URL's</span></p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">Affiliates may not put the Souss website in an I-Frame or mask our URL.</li></ul><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">PPC</span></p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">We accept PPC affiliates for all search networks however bidding on our brand name 'miss pap' or similar is not allowed.</li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">Bidding on terms similar to brand name such as 'miss pap&nbsp;promo code' is forbidden.</li></ul><p style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Affiliate Approvals</span></p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" whitney=\"\" ssm=\"\" a\",=\"\" \"whitney=\"\" b\",=\"\" tahoma,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\">Affiliates are checked for suitability and require a working URL before approval.</li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><b>Removal from Referral Program</b></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-kerning: none;\">If an affiliate wishes to be removed from the affiliate program, they can do so by contacting: contact@souss.online</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-kerning: none;\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><b>Go forward and refer!</b></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-kerning: none;\">We're very glad you've made it to the end of this important document.</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-kerning: none;\">We wish you all the very best. You can always re-visit these Affiliate Program terms and conditions in the future and if you have any questions you can send email to contact@souss.online&nbsp;for support.</span></p></li></ul> <p><br></p>\r\n<p><br></p>",
